<title>UK: Sweden sets 400 mln Danish crown bond due Dec 2004.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets 400 mln Danish crown bond due Dec 2004.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    15.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   FULL FEES  **	  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	**UNDISCLOSED</p>
